.TH ckman-fido-config 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-fido\-config \- Manage persistent FIDO authenticator configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-fido\-config\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage persistent FIDO authenticator configuration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ckman\-fido\-config\-toggle\-always\-uv(1)
Toggle the "always require user verification" setting
.TP
ckman\-fido\-config\-enable\-long\-touch\-for\-reset(1)
Require a long touch (up to 30 seconds) to confirm a FIDO reset
.TP
ckman\-fido\-config\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
